atar\n\t•\tFree Boombox\n\t•\tFree Coil\n\t•\tSeting Jump Lompat\n\t•\tFree Item Di Puncak\n\t•\tFree Cam All Device\n\t•\tBisa Gendong Banyak Teman\n\t•\tBisa Ganti Mode Time\n\t•\tSummit Cash Untuk Beli Aura\n\t•\tPlaylist Musik Dll\n\n🛍️ SHOP\n\t•\tVIP Title, Hashtag, Speed 32\n\t•\tScissors Tool\n\t•\tVIP Aura Sultan\n- Utamakan saling membantu tanpa memandang avatar untuk mencapai puncak bersama.!\n\n✨MAP MASIH DALAM PERKEMBANGAN\nUPDATE PANGGUNG DI PUNCAK INFO LANJJUT JOIN GRUB DC DI BAWAH UNTUK KOMUNIKASI⬇️","path":"/game/81293844847305-free-ava-mount-yukparty","slug":"81293844847305-free-ava-mount-yukparty","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5b262a56371f5b80a5987438312a840a1a0a94048e635e450df1b11336182d45.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2cd38bdc91978555af1c2a92f1ab830d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":583523,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-16T17:48:30.214Z","creator":{"name":"HerulAjaDeh","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":90713802495530,"name":"[🌋UPD 2] Steal a football team","desc":"Build your ultimate football team… by stealing it! ⚽💥\nIn Steal a Football Team you infiltrate enemy bases, dodge deadly lasers, and snatch their best players before they reach safety. Protect your base, upgrade your defenses, and take part in epic global events like the Champions Event to earn huge rewards.\n\n🏆 Key Features\n\nSteal players from other teams in real time\n\nProtect your base with lasers and traps\n\nEpic events with global boosts\n\nCustomize and expand your football empire\n\nCompete to become the #1 team owner\n\nCan you steal your way to the top?","path":"/game/90713802495530-upd-2-steal-a-football-team","slug":"90713802495530-upd-2-steal-a-football-team","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/c00cb623bc8e81b9b6e6ba4c09c9b0f2dbb4557463b08de0442da12cfc3544f1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-eceb734699be359218be8bcb5f21f9d4/150/150